        <span class="chip">Android Tips 2025</span>

        <span class="chip">Wi-Fi Optimization</span>

        <span class="chip">DNS</span>

        <span class="chip">Gaming Ping</span>

      </div>

      <h2>Safety Tips</h2>

      <ul>

        <li>Don’t install random “speed booster” apps.</li>

        <li>Update Android security patches.</li>

        <li>Use strong Wi-Fi passwords (WPA2/WPA3).</li>

      </ul>

    </aside>

  </section>

  <section class="card">

    <h2>Troubleshooting Matrix (Symptom → Likely Cause → Fix)</h2>

    <ul>

      <li><strong>High ping, normal speed</strong> → congestion/route → try WARP, different server, or 4G instead of public Wi-Fi.</li>

      <li><strong>Good Wi-Fi bars, slow speed</strong> → channel interference → change channel/width; move router.</li>

      <li><strong>Fast Wi-Fi, slow browsing</strong> → slow DNS → set Private DNS (above).</li>

      <li><strong>Great speeds, random drops</strong> → thermal throttling/app updates → cool device, pause updates.</li>

      <li><strong>Only one app is slow</strong> → app CDN/quality → clear cache, change app region/quality.</li>

    </ul>

  </section>

  <section class="card">

    <h2>Final Words</h2>

