            <p>Skills like driving, flying, and weapons improve with use. Dual-wield guns, recruit gang members, and manage properties for income.<span class="citation">[web:17]</span></p>
            <p>Side activities include dating, gambling, and races. Combat uses lock-on aiming with accuracy meters.<span class="citation">[web:12][web:17]</span></p>

