<h2>9. Set Best Control Layout</h2>

<p>Customize your on-screen buttons for better comfort and faster responses. A well-arranged layout can make a big difference in gameplay.</p><h2>10. Final Tips</h2>

<ul>

  <li>Use devices with at least 2GB RAM and good GPU.</li>

  <li>Play in performance mode (on Android battery settings).</li>

  <li>Keep your phone cool while gaming to avoid throttling.</li>

</ul><h2>Conclusion</h2>

